Task
Write a query to return all flights that have the status "Delayed":
Fetch the flight number, departure time, arrival time, departure airport, arrival airport, and status.
Only include flights with the status "Delayed".

query


select 
    flight_number, 
    departure_time, 
    arrival_time, 
    departure_airport, 
    arrival_airport, status
from Flights 
where status = 'Delayed'

